{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1520,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34c57bd9d87386ad5ed26f31",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "少し気合いを入れます。\r\n…やってやるぜぇぇぇ！\r\nうん。いい感じです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "22b08c5f538325e35fd18d6fc03671ed1e534b0987a69a8276411743316988bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e1e560cfd2776b7bc6571c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "心配はありません。勝利後\r\nインタビューで語る内容は\r\nきっちり暗記してますから。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d126790334c014c614ab6f4892d4c051ef1d6e302e6c0116e38416f7b1a0288",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10af0cdaa89af7ba9cdce256",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ついに来ましたね。\r\n今日こそ光となる時。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a7ef224e62dd1386e9fb371d159c227f230e6d46af371d90c229ca9c1e9da39",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98fa3cb87aa55f062c48101c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目指すは最高速一直線。\r\n私の速さで度肝を抜いてきます！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c054046faf16d21ac6a48bb6381d7bacca35d48283910e82e9cd282f91398c75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45443d51f5288702a0920e06",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "多少の不調は関係ないです…。\r\n一直線はお任せを。一直線は…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f1527a290f67a0abfdfa073b9da7e9da9934d3f504e7ab9c0ac45aa8961e73a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:907a96a524a9caad115b7575",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今は少しでも速くなれるイメージが\r\n必要。ここはプロングホーン…いや\r\nチーターのイメトレで…ぐるるる。",
      "source_fingerprint": "996b11c2c0f0e09783b244b9c0a942140eb67e5034ca6218fb697bdf263fab88",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d994e6083438929fe71d9a27",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目指す光は、まだ見えている…！\r\nならば追いついてみせるのみ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "56f1913d59bed8c3e2fbfefa972d954cb5870660a5d458b0bbf73a072e87455d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d19ec90ca8f9d0e6c8bffc41",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今の私を、脳内アニマルたちが\r\n嘲笑っている…！脳内コヨーテや\r\n脳内ヌーが…！負けてたまるか！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0ca0faad3f821023a4c6d7a0413c9e9ef66efa1456d6f5d9a99667459d0f3c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de8660d1ae8d5ce0d8d4a47c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "歩きすらふらふら曲線状態！？\r\nくっ、トレーナー、直線コールを！\r\n私は直線、一直線！…はい！",
      "source_fingerprint": "06c8815555dd9ff15ec16c2e373806fa024bee1813a56ceaaa3101f92985ae5b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34816c0aec99177f7657e3e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "万全でなくていい…\r\n直線…直線ですべてを\r\n突き放せさえすれば…っ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3583ad0bd5e5e165412b391193f4bcd0c3fafdf5b57995f26f4d9103ed888245",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3684a38e340741c7bc980627",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "えいや！",
      "source_fingerprint": "09c33cfeacb7dab7382d653749354a5e37ccd559003c543d3044ab2d364e9500",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c28fd1724bfcadc0adc72b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "うぉぉ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a17115eca75a1845b4e8ee62c215c5c0454e812f070fe1d5d11a892eb7834ad1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a1276d54ce22af73b008d52",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いくぞ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cba7776c7f432b141e5a619b9f8e42077ad110b65fd916413b0b5d7b49ddc152",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5aff81efcd5289597b063f22",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "余裕！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4339a5cc600cae21fa23e4176ce6559833bfc94768db4825f944029f9ae09f22",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9850bd6ab9562806b70ca69",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "なにっ！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "be4736805c0fc356b99e1810165d4dc458af6a94f60de28e41227a506b81823d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47c75ecb258d9fc532813dd8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "わからん！",
      "source_fingerprint": "673119318ade9ce0d3dde8991e283aab6b1eaed52dbaaeac622f20eed952120b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0375c6c23aed8d431be634d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早く速く！",
      "source_fingerprint": "55594fd14d198a4416c5fcfdc69aa3780dc340d8884302ff1f1a038fafd24919",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:005ca87d864317ff89bf46d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ばっしゃぁーん！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4a1ea63a6afd1b0a09d6da3100f5c34e8124cd8334ac75ca0df750433ea7364",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2cd4467728bffc54ee8424a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ご一緒した時間、光のように輝いていました。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b818a8d714d85432f26ca814c01d8c2e0a758f64d52cb12c9ca73b810ccd0ee4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a2f1389d745949db13c65ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ご指導ありがとうございました！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fce8804b80bc4bca14c035bc8af214a3c6ee66d8fe782a65cc55a5925d0f5389",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a5fc861874ce4382c70ee0b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "では…加速ッ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6725ac44f271c41ac62edfcdddbc622404c5130f527fd09f6d667a8d777db92e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbab7746aa7d2a1c90e21ea0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行くぞ、光速チーム！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c955ae95e6e2086698d4cc336236c5d6ac0f72121160ae0d496d3ac278b8148",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9d9162b4fc6d1e53dd5b436",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ご指導ありがとうございました！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fce8804b80bc4bca14c035bc8af214a3c6ee66d8fe782a65cc55a5925d0f5389",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f2bdc2a93fdcafad6e354f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "少し気合いを入れます。\r\n…やってやるぜぇぇぇ！\r\nうん。いい感じです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "22b08c5f538325e35fd18d6fc03671ed1e534b0987a69a8276411743316988bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0d076bc1696c80738c9d463",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いくら眩しくても目は閉じないで\r\nください。今日お見せするのが\r\n光速を超えた、私の最高速です！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d57990bc9eb7a96973cd4c618293c550518d4ede6ea6c968a3f44c9fea3230e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f300bf26e73d3c2231bce7ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ご指導ありがとうございました！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fce8804b80bc4bca14c035bc8af214a3c6ee66d8fe782a65cc55a5925d0f5389",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ef67406c388f39dd1782e88",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いくぞ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cba7776c7f432b141e5a619b9f8e42077ad110b65fd916413b0b5d7b49ddc152",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21d062cb2a2765e17e7dd1dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いける…次こそ、光の先へ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "edb3d75ce480aa06c7d1368f583b29e2078fe84f0a43302660e700c1f6dca36e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e93981ec293f36f371ad8100",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "光は、見えた…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e26fa96cdc78580edf5b60625830df80537845447d1778221fb2618a4c6fecc3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ab5d17526aa6e2075441b5d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最高速には至らず、か…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "028bbbb62559c59b214ce3b31759aba27a1e683fe13c840ea86f485da32bf866",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:549d00a33d5df81fe2dbe5df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "く…これではインパラにも笑われる…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "01080e97ab372d07d706a8839aac278e08260d03fc09b9a9847388fbe5a0bf7e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1891a20ff64672bb11f1d3c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "見えた。光を超えた世界…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "05c5630a1ef9e942000d76a129b988b98f3efe46f7d659ddfaf99043b8fc6b14",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6d2d3bcb5f81a53aea591f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "フッ、捉えられたかな。これが光の速さ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa285f8548615a98f4dc4949664fd22fb39b68676772bfa2d2d7de4867a99e20",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2986c4aac15fe308115fa331",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最高速へ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "74602b5a3c6a768f3357faf413bdfe3adf2939e51265640c82e5aceb15b4f6f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9fed72ea645f8f975b52b6c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "光より…速くッ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4bb271a66ae58c32441a9e4386142fc81c94991842e8b583cb186dfbdfbf2af3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8afcc05b25f96e3a8d834d21",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "風よりも、音よりも、光よりも…私はッ！\r\n…速い。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8c5704120e56573fc581c45c75f96cdbcf1d0924ebd122964f445e6467efd92",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82941faec616a3d6fc8cf18b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "フ、ステージの上にも光跡を残してくるか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e5fd3ca344ec15eb9dda6f9ba21ca679869c62747e65e64649fef95bf03a2e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c36e3bb68b05ed83a060c24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "皆さんに見てもらいます！ビカビカに輝く私を！",
      "source_fingerprint": "31240a463116ea9c7abf6e6e5bc0c8dd820fb9d6599689fab886e91650d4b931",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2def4b25b5fcbf3400b5b4ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一緒に最高速を目指しましょう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "81585908d614833b6c7a8e9e893e893d74d8ec980e0434fea57962a95179f1ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35339fe0c489c8ffe528a60c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "初めて会った時は…チャック、\r\nそしてテープで遅刻し一直線。\r\nうん、そんな感じでした！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5eb4f943f00389e111883949243db7efc6730b758c29562cb6d1cc26656a0bd4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83d9a64efe0ae57b89335dca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "健全な学生生活を送らねば、ですね。\r\n早寝早起き、早予習！",
      "source_fingerprint": "105cca0818dfaa2fedba25ead0b5ad422d0d74aa9b2c4679374a238cfe2c1d29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c6ad7ec7841f8b69d7a6acf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "フッ。光り輝くなら、\r\nやはりセンターが1番だな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f40ca89cc011fa5a86a36fc9b1d8e651980ffa04f69f5212b0250c933b81710",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c259f01b9c514b85c27547a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "肉眼ではとらえられませんよ。\r\nこの服で走る私はね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7312bc3cd2f5838f7a9fa5d639f90d43ff5ca55b83bf5e17d64a9284b947aed5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f50b2b754654d95735f7c1e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "シワは皆無です。一直線のシワなら\r\nギリ許してもいいですが。",
      "source_fingerprint": "44ca01fed751df273e1f1de24dbe708d7285e8465e9473b97f5167d055273129",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e720467b04d2e8ef1c2fc95a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "曲のテンポが光速に近づくほど、\r\n私は燃える！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba56dddf1d1c861129dcd2db326f57d7c767384bef996a356fa2404d89b56dae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e996eac86d49cf5cff97a39",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この衣装…やはり、\r\n心に真っ直ぐ線が通るな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d806b992923540d63f640d0b50956b33b6603450151a09a5dbe6f20b02d0c28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4260c644e9e87086b0291b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "着慣れた服であれば5秒以内。\r\n早着替えも最速です。",
      "source_fingerprint": "30d32bd14ad00f2d16ac75c30df7b5fe6c6dc593067a38f54ae4d2bf5223a96e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0b11730de3241309a3f1cf5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おや、猫の毛が…。\r\nもっと！もっとついてないか！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8692e7cfbeee73212ee1cbece91dab0b768005c8f863f7ef83ba6d74bf1d70a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b5cf35cf686642c678604d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "健全な学生生活を送らねば、ですね。\r\n早寝早起き、早予習！",
      "source_fingerprint": "105cca0818dfaa2fedba25ead0b5ad422d0d74aa9b2c4679374a238cfe2c1d29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d96fa6f169a857dcb774e80c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "フッ。光り輝くなら、\r\nやはりセンターが1番だな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f40ca89cc011fa5a86a36fc9b1d8e651980ffa04f69f5212b0250c933b81710",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a396f7e0aa69a69df7ad05c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "肉眼ではとらえられませんよ。\r\nこの服で走る私はね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7312bc3cd2f5838f7a9fa5d639f90d43ff5ca55b83bf5e17d64a9284b947aed5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96355c0145603fe89f375eab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "シワは皆無です。一直線のシワなら\r\nギリ許してもいいですが。",
      "source_fingerprint": "44ca01fed751df273e1f1de24dbe708d7285e8465e9473b97f5167d055273129",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:997f51f6e7442fb94d232b24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "曲のテンポが光速に近づくほど、\r\n私は燃える！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba56dddf1d1c861129dcd2db326f57d7c767384bef996a356fa2404d89b56dae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:958fd558f517b296da3cb746",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この衣装…やはり、\r\n心に真っ直ぐ線が通るな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d806b992923540d63f640d0b50956b33b6603450151a09a5dbe6f20b02d0c28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:334498c34645381db8d3d886",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "着慣れた服であれば5秒以内。\r\n早着替えも最速です。",
      "source_fingerprint": "30d32bd14ad00f2d16ac75c30df7b5fe6c6dc593067a38f54ae4d2bf5223a96e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8d3de7cc4d8b6711e3805db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おや、猫の毛が…。\r\nもっと！もっとついてないか！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8692e7cfbeee73212ee1cbece91dab0b768005c8f863f7ef83ba6d74bf1d70a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77904ee251d11d76089d60b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お疲れ様です",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba6d317ce3a2bfaf3d87ba426113b0a3498828395ba8d093265eb3539b78c491",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9079eff2be144c37448e93c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おはようからおやすみまで。\r\n今日も今日とて\r\n一直線に駆け抜けていきましょう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5cd5b6c00dada084c99d9917fa8db6cdc2f65d9660fb76d3532dfea94b939b3b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb3b8d49fbcac9e0341c8f32",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "朝6時に起きるのが私の習慣です。\r\n絶対6時。断じて6時。\r\nだって時計の針が一直線ですから。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6bf67cf2e1c1344a1b3392698732c1548214b0059b965de63dab0b8b6530748",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2089e440e06048f3952c9f6b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "フッ、お昼の時間か。1時限目\r\n時点で早弁した私には無用…\r\nいや。やっぱりお腹空きました。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ba56cc6bbf22e61682a0edbf294e787e902f31f8692000fbb0fe0a75b661393",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1839e07d44b7f5ec753a206",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "食後の授業は眠いですが…大丈夫。\r\nそういう時は、脳内のホエザルに\r\n起こしてもらえば一発です。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e9c1bdb1b22602190fd32e8feefce9ff404cb74dff2297522303cf334519947",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11bf3a827d3571196929ed22",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今日も残すところあと少し…いわば\r\n最終直線！最後まで気を抜かず…\r\nふぁ～～ああ…行きましょう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8f9a3249b8fe2c092e34c1b14b0358033ab749e944230e27db56b020d44f354",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33fefffc43c1ca6f025738f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私の寝相は常に完璧、真っ直ぐな\r\n気をつけ姿勢。毎朝、規則正しく\r\nベッド脇の定位置に落下しています",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7b9984f1a95568817a030f702966e5c1c87820af97323363c17229a5e4eee1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a5ad72c738d67e8c7c8f409",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今日から私、お花見生活です。\r\nああ、週末お花見することになった\r\nので、今から公園で場所取りをと。",
      "source_fingerprint": "775ea5dc54fdcddfbd0e60d08b66345246eeb4f88c591cb7a00ae1856d11dcb2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30d64fae111974e1fb0a06ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この灼熱も、脳内の熱帯雨林で\r\n繰り広げたジャガー軍団との\r\nレースに比べたら、何のその…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8e5c19e5425cb5e8dffa44081612e54cc34333ddebb7a3d6b9d0724bfb859e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:219034cbe8925faa88765950",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "速読の秋、早食いの秋。\r\nフッ…私の最高速を存分に\r\nお披露目できる季節が来たな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "73e8cc9830ab5632a2d628e08c0bfb4d14107a5eeff490fc97c2bb70f205f753",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9eea1bb6990cdcafeaf0ba1d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "乾燥の季節、クリームの装備は必須\r\nですからね。乾燥を感知しだい取り\r\n出せるよう袖口に備えています。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5c8fb3a52b969917019191f15b60b93026eec862d8096c74dbdd6284cf1a068",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3cb081826fc2bc6eac1aed86",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "バレンタインですね",
      "source_fingerprint": "df378f9c19407569b84c5dcf3b3a8adc3fc2d5e1a1f540f4d81ad34db8009cf6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efdde2f6fd3bb71610e1e136",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私の髪は常にぱっつん、真っ直ぐ、\r\nずーっとです。小さい頃お母さんが\r\n初めて整えてくれた時から、ずっと",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d757b8d97c7a22a0869ec52a67cf2eca8964f83e54f6cdc4792abf60eb977e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:944cdfebc134e7575422696f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "昔は算数や数学が好きだったのに、\r\n裏切られました。内容が進むたびに\r\n曲線が出しゃばってきて…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c10e6072c0d4a3dec3d815448e34c4a903c073adfee82826b673c47c3761f188",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b3273cc8a68fbbdb8737cef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ときどきデュランダルと箒とかで\r\n戦うのですが…『光速直線突き』が\r\nいつもいなされる…なぜだっ！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "055b0048e09ec8be8e2c37efd251f7fc52b0a363367158d80ccd5a313712d4fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f5e1a70025dd9f724be1a95",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "皆、ビリーヴを規範とすべきです。\r\n背筋も机もタオルの折り目もぴんと\r\nきちっと真っ直ぐなのですから！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f1cbaf509643082ad6e220941d8dfc999b487a626751ea5379998c0ace1a0f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88d01e261c81dc0efaa0aa13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "タキオンが“光”に関係する実験を\r\nしていると聞きました。よくわかり\r\nませんが、私も協力すべきですね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b86ea90f57dbb4d17a66c7329fd29a0d8091858f81dedd13ddf67a4b9b7507fe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28c3f2c31f98c6a9ce6f825b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "せっかくの衣装、1曲舞いましょう\r\n…ソーラン節とか。光速を超える\r\nキビキビの舞、ご覧にいれます！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a0c2543a21e6396e8e3718c064f566afec08bbff0ac8e6d14768e4c1387f841",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8407b32043840f467eb542d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私の光速ダンスについてこられる\r\n生地はそうありませんからね。\r\n見事な出来映え。あっぱれです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0de5270e2d612c13b2eb95ef454249e8168cae58665e862f871dd1a9842557dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82109c9362eab53d386f72c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "勝負服はウマ娘の魂…\r\n日々アイロンをかけ、よりよい\r\n直線を保ってゆかねば。",
      "source_fingerprint": "057e7b2bb6c2e0bf5ae933f3dc537de773fb4edec88a11f71b851f7853658a8c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83f5110b5028103d4daf52d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "腰ひもの結び方にはこだわりが\r\nあります。意地でも丸みは\r\nおびさせませんとも…ええ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6053cd754d66b7a4cc79f5e1e3c2377c19a806c487f84884f5be9ae60be76a60",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f851dc82709c30963b43982f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私の髪は常に真っ直ぐ。\r\n寝ぐせなど見つけた朝には\r\nオイルでばしゅんの即KOです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff7a915495bbe806212fd8abd97bf65da38a74829f87db73e18d1488aa49cbcc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:acb410188668fd3781e5d33c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "近々カフェテリアに短期間限定の\r\nメニューが出るとか。短期間…\r\n誰よりも、最速で味わわねば！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d094c9353db719e2df0cec3e2135297aa73a0efc4742d2f6c88e7088cf39840",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8347137cfc241822cd072b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "むっ！？暗がりに光る目…！\r\n猫！？きっと猫に違いないっ！\r\n早急に確認してこなければっ！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5eddf5c4a0b4e898f8730bdc51afd2e715e8074696acc376ddf1bce9d6269b7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "91011"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
